<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sei_ge_cowbell01.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\喫茶店中2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Oh, <STYLE ID="1">Chigaya</STYLE>, sorry I'm late."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Sorry for calling you out here, Hana-chan."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It's fine. But... 
{PAUSE ""}
Is this place okay? It looks pretty expensive..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... I came here with </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> the other day. Today's my treat."</STYLE><PG>
"Hey, <STYLE ID="1">Chigaya</STYLE>... What's going on with you lately?
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Erica.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
　You've looked kind of down, and you haven't been coming to parties at all..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Is something bothering you?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Hana-chan, that's what I wanted to talk to you about today."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Okay..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Starting tomorrow, I'm going back to my family's home for a while."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oh, that <STYLE ID="3">relative's</STYLE> thirteenth-year memorial, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Yeah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Is that all? That's not all that's bothering you, is it?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... I... might not be able to come back."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What!? You're quitting school!?
{PAUSE ""}
　A forced marriage to a <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="いいなずけ">fiance</STYLE> or something!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... It's not that..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hey, <STYLE ID="1">Chigaya</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="1">you're</STYLE> my best friend. 
{PAUSE ""}
So... I want you to come back..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... I want to come back too."</STYLE><PG>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Is it something that's hard to talk about?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... It's not so much that it's hard to talk about... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I don't know if you'd understand even if I told you... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Or rather, it's a really complicated story."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I see... 
{PAUSE ""}
Is there anything I can do?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE><PG>
"So it's too hard for me to do anything about."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... I'm going to tell the truth to you, Hana-chan, and only you."</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Okay..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... I... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">might die."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\夢見る憧憬.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... So... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I wanted to say a proper goodbye to you, Hana-chan..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">You</STYLE> don't want to die, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Yeah... I want to live and see you again, Hana-chan."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Then you'll be fine, <STYLE ID="1">Chigaya</STYLE>. <STYLE ID="1">You're</STYLE> super strong."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE><PG>
"I believe it. 
{PAUSE ""}
That <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> and I will go hunting for good guys together again."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Yeah... Thank you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Chigaya</STYLE>, you must be scared. You have to go, even though you might die. 
{PAUSE ""}
But... 
{PAUSE ""}
It'll be okay. The <STYLE ID="1">Chigaya</STYLE> I know would never lose."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah..."</STYLE><PG>
"Because... 
{PAUSE ""}
Because you've been dumped by over 100 men and never once been discouraged!
{PAUSE ""}
　Someone as strong as <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> will be fine!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Hehe, you're right. Maybe I'm surprisingly strong."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"For when <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> come back, I'll have the best guys all lined up!
{PAUSE ""}
　If you've got something to look forward to, you'll want to come back here even more, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Yeah, thank you, Hana-chan. I'll definitely come back."</STYLE><PG>
"Yeah, yeah! I'm definitely gonna find a good guy too!
{PAUSE ""}
　I'll get past the gender wall too, just watch!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... There aren't many women as </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="しと">ladylike</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> as you, Hana-chan. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">You're more womanly than any woman."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"All right! Then today's not a farewell party, but a declaration-of-resolve party!
{PAUSE ""}
　When <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> come back, let's both catch ourselves some good guys!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Yeah! Thank you."</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
